 "9834": {
  "en": [
   "Come on, come on, brother — let us hurry and go on ahead.",
   "Search with all your might, this wood, that wood —",
   "come, a few of us will go that way.",
   "No, no, brother, it is no use,",
   "there is nothing there, nothing at all;",
   "perhaps in that bush we may find something.",
   "A boar, a boar —",
   "Hey, wait, wait — so hasty and the prey will slip away;",
   "come softly, softly; come softly, softly under the peepul tree;",
   "now everyone hold steady and ready;",
   "careful — draw the arrow; careful — loose the arrow.",
   "It's gone, gone — there, there — it's escaping, escaping — come on, come on.",
   "Run after it — come, let us hurry."
