 "9840": {
  "en": [
   "No more, no more — no more of this place;",
   "come, all of you, let us go away.",
   "The chief has thrown down his bow and arrow —",
   "how can we stay here, brother!",
   "Come, come, come — let us go this instant.",
   "Your state, chief, is not good at all —",
   "you take fright at bloodshed —",
   "we could die of shame.",
   "When a bird is killed you weep yourself to death —",
   "who knows who has cast a spell on you —",
   "we have never seen the like."
