 "9841": {
  "en": [
   "Nothing has come of this life, alas —",
   "nothing came, oh nothing came — alas, alas.",
   "How long shall I wander from thicket to thicket, in this darkness of despair?",
   "I can no longer bear this empty heart,",
   "I cannot, oh I cannot any more.",
   "With what shall I now hold on to life? Day and night pass away —",
   "day and night pass away —",
   "Desire rises, saying: how much I would do,",
   "but what to do I do not know.",
   "Those who were my companions have forsaken me; I have forsaken bow and arrow,",
   "no work is left to me —",
   "crying what shall I do, what shall I do, I wander wailing —",
   "what to do I do not know!"
