 "9847": {
  "en": [
   "Shyama, this time I am leaving you, Mother!",
   "Daughter of stone, you are stone yourself; unknowing, I called you Mother, Mother!",
   "All this time, by what trickery did you keep me turned to stone —",
   "today, having found my own Mother, I have melted into tears, Mother!",
   "The dark no longer beguiles me; the light has beguiled my mind —",
   "you deceived me once; this time I have deceived you, Mother!",
   "Cutting through illusion's snare, this time I go to my Mother's lap, Mother."
