 "9850": {
  "en": [
   "Where is that dawn-radiant image?",
   "You are not that goddess, lady of the lotus throne —",
   "do not practice deception on me.",
   "What wealth and honor you have brought — my heart does not want them.",
   "Goddess, I want it not, I want it not — these jeweled heaps of dust I want not,",
   "let those be happy with them who may — so be it, so be it —",
   "I, goddess, do not want that happiness.",
   "Go, Lakshmi, to Alaka; go, Lakshmi, to Amaravati;",
   "do not come, do not come to this forest,",
   "do not come to this poor man's hut.",
   "The vina I have heard with my ears keeps mind and soul entranced —",
   "I want nothing else — I want it not."
  ],
  "align": [
